<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait private deposits down in September.</title>
<headline>Kuwait private deposits down in September.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private sector deposits with banks in Kuwait fell to 6.765 billion dinars at the end of September from 6.972 billion at the end of August, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The deposits stood at 7.088 billion in September 1995.</p>
<p>			  Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				   Sept	  Aug	Sept '95</p>
<p>Dinar deposits		5,507.8    5,565.8    5,721.4</p>
<p>Foreign currency deposits 1,257.1    1,406.2    1,367.0</p>
<p>($1 = 0.2988 dinar)</p>
<p>-- Inal Ersan, Kuwait newsroom +965-243-1920</p>
</text>
